# Alembic Migrations

This directory contains Alembic migration scripts for the AISMM database.

## Commands

```bash
# Create a new migration (auto-generated from models)
cd backend
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

# Apply latest migration
alembic upgrade head

# Roll back one migration
alembic downgrade -1

# Stamp current DB as at latest revision (no migration run)
alembic stamp head
```

## Configuration

- `alembic.ini` — Alembic configuration
- `env.py` — Migration environment, loads models from `backend.app.db.models`
- `script.py.mako` — Template for new migration files
- `versions/` — Generated migration scripts

## Model Registry

All SQLAlchemy models are registered in `backend/app/db/models.py` and imported in `env.py` so Alembic can detect schema changes automatically.